			"y": -360,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "## Legend\n**Cards** 🟩 played · 🟨 partial · ⬜ planned · 🟥 skipped\n**Stepped right** optional or alternative beat\n**Arrows** grey = sequence · 🟩 = the path the table took · 🟧 = branch\n**Red cards** IF states (far right) and XP: 🟥 awards, ⚔ combat (left)\n\nGenerated by Taleform from beat frontmatter: edit the notes, not these cards. Drag freely — positions survive a regenerate, and anything you add by hand is kept.",
			"generated": "adventure-map"
		},
